        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this lovely 1 BED / 1 BATH APARTMENT to the rental market located in Montpellier Court, Tallaght, Dublin 24. The property comprises of an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious lounge area, a fully fitted kitchen, one double bedroom and one main bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe apartment is well presented throughout and offers comfortable living space throughout. In terms of location, Montpellier Court is ideally situated close to Tallaght Village with every conceivable amenity on its doorstep including shops, restaurants, schools, and leisure facilities. \r\n\r\nThe area is well served by excellent public transport links including various bus routes and easy access to the LUAS Red Line providing quick and easy access to Dublin City Centre, Tallaght Hospital and The Square Shopping Centre are also just a short distance away. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised! Features: One double bedroom, one bathroom, bright and spacious living area, fully fitted kitchen, well-presented throughout, excellent transport links nearby, every amenity within walking distance, short distance to Tallaght Village, Tallaght Hospital and The Square Shopping Centre."
